{"id":"word:hebrew:H3612","type":"word","title":"כָּלֵב","subtitle":"H3612 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Caleb , the name of three Israelites","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to כָּלֵב (H3612) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 35 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"כָּלֵב (Kâlêb) means Caleb , the name of three Israelites First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"כָּלֵב","transliteration":"Kâlêb","pronunciation":"kaw-labe'","strong":"H3612","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3612","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["כָּלֵ֖ב","כָּלֵ֔ב","כָּלֵ֣ב","לְ/כָלֵ֥ב","כָלֵב֙"],"morphs":[["HNp",26],["HR/Np",5],["HC/Np",3],["HC/R/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Caleb , the name of three Israelites","usage":"Caleb.","full":"H3612. Kaleb כָּלֵב proper name, masculine (Nabataean proper name כלבא Eut (Nö) p. 55 . כלבו Vog Nab. 6 ; compare also We Skizzen u. Vorarbeiten iii. 217 ; on כָּלֵב = dog-clan , see RS K 17, 190 f., 219, 254 ); — son of יְפֻנֶּה ( ᵐ5 Ξαλεβ ; compare Lag BN 78 ), called הַקְּנִזִּי (see קְנַז ) in J E, Num 32:12 ; Josh 14:6 , 14 , compare 15:17 = Judg 1:13 ; 3:9 (where קְנַז is brother of ׳כ ), also 1Chr 4:15 ; treated as full Judahite only in P Num 13:6 (see GFM Ju p. 30 f. ) the one of the spies who (with Joshua) reported well of Canaan 14:6 , 24 , 30 , 38 ; also 26:65 ; 34:19 ; Deut 1:36 ; Josh 14:13 ; 15:13-14 , 16 , 18 ; 21:12 (P = 1Chr 6:41 ) Judg 1:12 , 14 , 15 , 20 (|| with Joshua 15); = clan of Caleb 1Sam 30:14 (distinguished from Judah). Caleb is called בֶּןחֶֿצְרוֺן 1Chr 2:18 , compare 2:19 ; 2:42 ; 2:46 ; 2:48 ; 2:49 ; 2:50 = כְּלוּבָ֑י 2:9 ; אֶפְרָתָה בְּכָלֵב 2:24 , read perh כ ׳בָּא , so ᵑ9 ᵐ5 , compare Kau AT (see אֶפְרָתָה above)","rootNote":"perhaps a form of 3611 , or else from the same root in the sense of forcible;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 18","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 18","1Chr 2 19","1Chr 2 42","1Chr 2 46","1Chr 2 48","1Chr 2 49","1Chr 2 50","1Chr 4 15"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":35,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/כָלֵ֣ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָלֵב֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 42","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָלֵב֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 46","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":46,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵ֔ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 48","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":48,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵב֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 49","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":49,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 50","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":50,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָלֵ֔ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵ֣ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/כָלֵ֥ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 14","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵ֑ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 1 36","book":"Deut","chapter":1,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵ֤ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Josh 14 6","book":"Josh","chapter":14,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּלֵ֥ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Josh 14 13","book":"Josh","chapter":14,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/כ